usage: - [-h] [--destination DESTINATION] [--dry-run] [--timeout TIMEOUT]

Restore exact REA6.5.0 into a fresh outside-checkout directory. No Ghidra
install or persistent agent configuration.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --destination DESTINATION
  --dry-run             Validate inputs/tools and print the plan; no
                        filesystem writes or network requests.
  --timeout TIMEOUT     Per-process deadline,1–600seconds.
